Ophelia (Funeral-Speak): Urseline was my everything, my world.
Ophelia (Funeral-Speak): She showed me how it was like to step into the world and not cower. She was with me every moment since the beginning, and I can't thank her enough for that. She’s the only reason I’m still her today, she, she-
Ophelia (Funeral-Speak): Umm Even if there were moments, when I couldn’t… help her, I wish she knew how much I cared , like the night she… \
I’ll never forgive myself for the words I said to her that night.
Ophelia (Funeral-Angry): I told her to leave! That I didn’t want to see her again! And now she’s gone! And I can't take back my words… I didn’t even get to tell her I loved her! I don’t even deserve to be here after what I said to her, it's my fault she died… My fault!
